ols-3\"><div class=\"bg-[var(--surface)] p-7\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[var(--blue)]\">Vision</p><p class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]\">To become a leading multidisciplinary consultancy serving Balochistan and beyond through professional excellence, innovation and sustainable engineering solutions.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[var(--surface)] p-7\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[var(--blue)]\">Mission</p><p class=\"mt-5 text-[15px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]\">To provide integrated, practical and cost-effective solutions that help our clients successfully plan, design and deliver their projects.</p></div><div class=\"bg-[var(--surface)] p-7\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[var(--blue)]\">Values</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Integrity</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Professionalism</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Quality</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Safety</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Innovation</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-[var(--border)] px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]\">Accountability</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"approach\" class=\"bg-[var(--paper)] px-6 py-28 md:py-36\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl\"><div class=\"grid gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[0.7fr_1.3fr]\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[var(--blue)]\">Our approach</p><h2 class=\"mt-5 max-w-md text-4xl font-medium leading-[0.95] tracking-