.</p></article><article class=\"group bg-[var(--surface)] p-7 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[var(--paper)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--blue)]\">07</span><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-[var(--blue)]/20 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-12 group-hover:bg-[var(--blue)]\"></span></div><h3 class=\"mt-12 text-xl font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-[var(--ink)]\">Project Management</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]\">Monitor schedule, cost, quality and progress.</p></article><article class=\"group bg-[var(--surface)] p-7 transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-[var(--paper)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--blue)]\">08</span><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-[var(--blue)]/20 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:w-12 group-hover:bg-[var(--blue)]\"></span></div><h3 class=\"mt-12 text-xl font-medium tracking-[-0.03em] text-[var(--ink)]\">Completion</h3><p class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] leading-7 text-[var(--muted)]\">Final inspection, documentation and handover.</p></article></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"relative overflow-hidden bg-[#07111F] px-6 py-28 text-white md:py-36\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-30\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0\" style=\"background-image:linear-gradient(\n                to right,\n                rgba(79,143,210,0.08) 1px,\n                transparent 1px\n              ),\n              linear-gradient(\n                to bottom,\n                rgba(79,143,210,0.08) 1px,\n                transparent 1px\n              );background-size:60px 60px\"></div></div><div class=\"relative mx-auto max-w-5xl text-center\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-[#4F8FD2]\">Sta